          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "errin.pace@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 17 2022 18:41:35 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2>Fast Track to Early Mobility<br>\n</h2>\n<p>Stryker’s prevention policy is product + process = prevention. As part of that philosophy, we have created our early mobility program to help caregivers reduce the complications of immobility. Our program provides systematic means to educate staff on looking closely at existing policies and standards of care, update patient safety supported by evidence, and utilize hospital equipment to help nursing and ancillary staff in their efforts to keep patients safe and comply with facility policies.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Apr 22 2022 21:03:56 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
