          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 17 2022 18:41:35 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2>Early Mobility Program Results in Improved Patient Outcomes and Cost Savings<br>\n</h2>\n<p><b>Authors:</b>&nbsp;Lilia Hansen, MSN, MBA, RN, CCRN, Sarah Malcom MSN, RN, Heidi Brooks MSN APRN-FNP</p>\n<p>An intensive care unit (ICU) at Nebraska Methodist Hospital implemented an early mobility program to enhance patient safety in their clinical environment.</p>\n<p>The following case history outlines their efforts and the results of their quality improvement (QI) initiative.<br>\n</p>\n",
